{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0004": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0005": "$f(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_S(V) \\to \\mathcal{O}_X(U)$", "MATH_0007": "$S = \\bigcup_{j \\in J} V_j$", "MATH_0008": "$f^{-1}(V_j) = \\bigcup_{i \\in I_j} U_i$", "MATH_0009": "$U_i \\to V_j$", "MATH_0010": "$j\\in J, i\\in I_j$", "MATH_0011": "$S = \\bigcup_{j \\in J} V_j$", "MATH_0012": "$f^{-1}(V_j) = \\bigcup_{i \\in I_j} U_i$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}_S(V_j) \\to \\mathcal{O}_X(U_i)$", "MATH_0014": "$j\\in J, i\\in I_j$", "MATH_0015": "$f$", "MATH_0016": "$U \\subset X$", "MATH_0017": "$V \\subset S$", "MATH_0018": "$f(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0019": "$f|_U : U \\to V$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-syntomic-characterize}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:831157cffc4f322e7a359b1d2895997bfe94b41d1a431cf27d30599a8144b2c2", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:44bc87fd7650681beec8fabc6d60e3e838a3690a21dcaa7e71fa1321b1865c26", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The morphism <MATH_0002> is syntomic.\n<STRUCT_0003> For every affine opens <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004>\nwith <MATH_0005> the ring map\n<MATH_0006> is syntomic.\n<STRUCT_0004> There exists an open covering <MATH_0007>\nand open coverings <MATH_0008> such\nthat each of the morphisms <MATH_0009>, <MATH_0010>\nis syntomic.\n<STRUCT_0005> There exists an affine open covering <MATH_0011>\nand affine open coverings <MATH_0012> such\nthat the ring map <MATH_0013> is\nsyntomic, for all <MATH_0014>.\n<STRUCT_0006>\nMoreover, if <MATH_0015> is syntomic then for\nany open subschemes <MATH_0016>, <MATH_0017> with <MATH_0018>\nthe restriction <MATH_0019> is syntomic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ec6333a96c7408d1a49d0d93662700a45efcbd2ef4f13d53ed523d0589118b89", "unit_id": "tag:01UD:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$R \\to A$", "MATH_0002": "$R$", "MATH_0003": "$R \\to R_f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-locally-P}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{definition-property-local}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-base-change-syntomic}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-composition-syntomic}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-syntomic}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bc2db76c8a8e1537c9fcf3533cdd4a095e9d9ce0d5b7b414c27b35e406497aa9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b5b26e17c8e88f2aef1f6016b7caf07899c6f759025e0404d187d9bbdf5e97ff", "source_text": "This follows from Lemma <REF_0001> if we show that\nthe property ``<MATH_0001> is syntomic'' is local.\nWe check conditions (a), (b) and (c) of Definition\n<REF_0002>.\nBy Algebra, Lemma <REF_0003>\nbeing syntomic is stable under base change and hence\nwe conclude (a) holds. By\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0004>\nbeing syntomic is stable under composition and trivially for any ring\n<MATH_0002> the ring map <MATH_0003> is syntomic.\nWe conclude (b) holds. Finally, property (c) is true\naccording to Algebra, Lemma <REF_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3b0678681609d66065f972e3a197273f560b5b5caeaeb590ede486ca6d914b7c", "unit_id": "tag:01UD:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-syntomic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:961c55061e1bf791882a3fac8d80310e2ce8f9977e3895be33fb44f86a10b316", "source_text": "The composition of two morphisms which are syntomic is syntomic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4a20406b1b5f0dd3c5b2a17f7179b8a9c3eb7e297f6f475cd6b4e7c5a2d59309", "unit_id": "tag:01UH:statement"}
